            "title": "Fabrinet: The AI Infrastructure Opportunity Is Bigger Than Valuation Suggests",
            "description": "<html><body><p data-eci=\"true\"><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Fabrinet West headquarters in Silicon Valley\" data-id=\"1203607136\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1025\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1203607136/image_1203607136.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1203607136/image_1203607136.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1203607136/image_1203607136.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1203607136/image_1203607136.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1203607136/image_1203607136.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1203607136/image_1203607136.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1203607136/image_1203607136.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1203607136/image_1203607136.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/1203607136/image_1203607136.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">Sundry Photography/iStock Editorial via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure></p>  <h2>Investment Thesis</h2> <p>I am initiating coverage of Fabrinet (<span class=\"ticker-hover-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FN\" title=\"Fabrinet\">FN</a></span>) with a Strong Buy rating and a price target of $677. This represents about 39% upside from its <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FN\">current price</a> of $488 as</p></body></html>",
